              "content": "=Company Name: {{ $json.company_name }}\nCompany URL: {{ $json.company_url }}\n\nWebsite Content:\n{{ $json.cleaned_text }}\n\nYou are a senior B2B sales intelligence analyst.\n\nAnalyze the company and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Return ONLY raw JSON\n- No markdown\n- No explanation\n- No ```json\n- No extra text\n- All fields required\n- outreach_messages must contain exactly 3 messages\n- data_quality_issues must always be an array\n\nRequired JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"company_name\": \"\",\n  \"company_url\": \"\",\n  \"company_summary\": \"\",\n  \"industry\": \"\",\n  \"company_type\": \"\",\n  \"lead_score\": \"\",\n  \"fit_score\": 0,\n  \"reasoning\": \"\",\n  \"growth_opportunities\": \"\",\n  \"competitors\": \"\",\n  \"subject_line_1\": \"\",\n  \"subject_line_2\": \"\",\n  \"subject_line_3\": \"\",\n  \"outreach_messages\": [\n    \"\",\n    \"\",\n    \"\"\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": \"\",\n  \"data_quality_issues\": []\n}\n\nScoring Rules:\n- Hot = strong fit + high growth + likely buyer\n- Warm = moderate fit\n- Cold = low fit\n\nFit Score:\n- Integer from 1-100\n\nCompany Type Examples:\n- Startup\n- SMB\n- Mid-Market\n- Enterprise\n\nConfidence:\n- low\n- medium\n- high\n\nAnalyze the company deeply:\n- business model\n- ICP\n- marketing maturity\n- likely acquisition channels\n- SEO maturity\n- paid ads potential\n- enterprise readiness\n- AI adoption\n- growth signals\n\nWrite highly personalized outreach messages for a digital marketing / growth agency.\n\nThe outreach should:\n- reference real business context\n- mention likely pain points\n- suggest growth opportunities\n- sound human\n- avoid generic sales language\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON."
            }
